.parity-build/
.gates-build/

# The N.I.N.A. plugin moved to github.com/zakky2k/unphased-nina-plugin on 26 Nov 2026, so this
# folder is a pointer only. Its stale .NET build output is ignored here, in case it stays on disk.
nina-plugin/bin/
nina-plugin/obj/
nina-plugin/artifacts/
nina-plugin/TestResults/
nina-plugin/local.props
*.user

# Kept for the same reason: the `build/` rule above is web build output, but it also matches a
# plugin-style build/ folder anywhere, and git will not look inside an excluded directory. While
# the plugin lived here that silently swallowed its release tooling (Plugin.targets,
# Build-Release.ps1, the vendored manifest schema) - a fresh clone could not build or package.
# Removing these two lines also un-hid 16 build artefacts as new files to commit, so they stay.
!nina-plugin/UnphasedNina/build/
!nina-plugin/UnphasedNina/build/**

web/app/_edgedump/
